## Sample Configuration

Configs in `configs/` have passwords and keys removed.

```
! L3 core: SVI with DHCP relay
interface vlan 20
 ip address 10.1.0.33 255.255.255.224
 ip helper-address 20.0.0.10
 no shutdown

! RIP v2
router rip
 version 2
 no auto-summary
 network 10.0.0.0
 network 20.0.0.0
 passive-interface default
 no passive-interface gigabitEthernet 0/1
```

