## Future Enhancements

- Backup WAN or VPN link to remove the single point of failure
- Redundant core switch or EtherChannel uplinks
- Firewall at the WAN edge
- ACLs limiting SSH to the IT VLAN, then AAA (TACACS+/RADIUS)
- Move from RIP to OSPF as the network grows
- SFTP/FTPS in place of plain FTP
- Monitoring (SNMP/syslog) and a documented maintenance schedule

